rom the left wrist and the other three Xarwins in a line cutting across their brows-as the viewers receive glimpses of the traumas the family endured.</p>","disable":"<p>@Check[religion|dc:25|name:Exorcise Painting] to exorcise one of the paintings (a critical success exorcises all of the paintings at once) or @Check[thievery|dc:21|name:Cover a Painting|traits:action:disable-a-device] to quickly cover a painting with a cloak or remove it and turn it to face the wall</p>","isComplex":true,"level":{"value":6},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Adventure: Malevolence"},"reset":"<p>1 hour; putting Xarwin's ghost to rest destroys this haunt forever.</p>","routine":"<p>(4 actions) The haunt uses up to 4 actions to afflict bleeding wounds on different creatures in area B22. These bloody wounds manifest where the target would have felt pain from Inflict Agony, regardless of whether they succeeded in resisting that effect or not. A creature can't be targeted more than once by this routine. Each creature affected must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:24|traits:emotion,fear,mental,necromancy,occult] save.</p>\n<p>The haunt loses 1 action for each painting that's disabled or destroyed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(1d8+3)[slashing]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} by the conviction that these wounds were caused by a loved one.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but @Damage[(2d8+6)[slashing]] damage, @Damage[1d6[bleed]], and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[(4d8+12)[slashing]] damage, @Damage[2d6[bleed]], and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}. Increase the value of the character's malevolence condition by 1.</p>"},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":17},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":11},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":18}},"statusEffects":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["haunt"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"hazard","effects":[]},{"_id":"etVnNsUFpgeOBFJO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/hazard.svg","items":["4adbMachVzb84sGG"],"name":"Carrion Vortex","system":{"attributes":{"ac":{"value":24},"hardness":10,"hasHealth":true,"hp":{"details":"","max":58,"temp":0,"value":58},"immunities":[{"type":"precision"},{"type":"critical-hits"}],"stealth":{"details":"<p>(Expert)</p>","value":15},"weaknesses":[{"type":"vitality","value":7}]},"creatureType":"","details":{"description":"<p>The countless bones and feathers on the floor churn into the air in a clattering swarm of partially reconstructed skeletal birds, whose mournful song fills the area as surely as do their slashing beaks and talons.</p>","disable":"<p>@Check[nature|dc:23|name:Convince Carrion You Pose No Threat] to convince the carrion vortex that the PCs pose no ill intent or @Check[religion|dc:20|name:Exorcise the Haunt] to exorcise the haunt</p>","isComplex":true,"level":{"value":6},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Adventure: Malevolence"},"reset":"<p>24 hours; defeating the corrupted psychopomps in areas D5 and E4 destroys this haunt forever.</p>","routine":"<p>(1 action; evocation, occult) The churning vortex of beaks and bones takes its action through area D2, clawing and pecking at any creature in the area. All creatures in area D2 take @Damage[(2d8+9)[slashing]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:24|basic|traits:evocation,occult] save).</p>"},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":11},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":17},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":15}},"statusEffects":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["haunt"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"hazard","effects":[]},{"_id":"fQClrtmAe3AER0w2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/hazard.svg","items":["tcBafn7uVyBovL1F"],"name":"Lured to Ashes","system":{"attributes":{"ac":{"value":22},"hardness":12,"hasHealth":true,"hp":{"details":"","max":50,"temp":0,"value":50},"immunities":[{"type":"precision"},{"type":"critical-hits"}],"stealth":{"details":"<p>(Expert)</p>","value":13},"weaknesses":[{"type":"vitality","value":5}]},"creatureType":"","details":{"description":"<p>The illusory scene of a furnished study covers the room's actual appearance. It flickers and fades, revealing a scorched and burnt chamber. A moment later, the screams of burning victims fill the room, and blazing skeletal arms reach from the ashes and charred walls to scrape and claw.</p>","disable":"<p>@Check[intimidation|dc:26|name:Silence the Spirits|traits:action:coerce] to command the spirits haunting this room to be silent or @Check[religion|dc:23|name:Exorcise the Haunt] to exorcise the haunt</p>","isComplex":true,"level":{"value":5},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Adventure: Malevolence"},"reset":"<p>8 hours; destroying the tanglebones in area E3 destroys this haunt forever.</p>","routine":"<p>1 Action: If there are no targets within area B18 when the haunt takes its action, it can use its Lure reaction to try to get nearby victims back inside. The haunt manifests several burning skeletal arms that reach up from the ruined floors or out of the burnt walls to claw at every creature in area B18. These creatures must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:22|name:Lured to Ashes Fire|traits:damaging-effect,fire,necromancy,occult] save (creatures seated on a sofa take a -2 circumstance penalty to this saving throw).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature takes no damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[1d8[fire]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[2d8[fire]] damage and gains weakness 5 to fire. This weakness persists until the creature is fully healed.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[4d8[fire]] damage and weakness 10 to fire.</p>"},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":15},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":15},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":9}},"statusEffects":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["haunt"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"hazard","effects":[]},{"_id":"n3taMFiViyEQ5JAi","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/npc.svg","items":["gBE8Z8acvqFsiw0Z","zPjV1ZAzpCHAWFM2","xGY7GCQOzgOM1SMh","jG6GxmsEvSUZnXxj","2RdmSsdUu4VVJeUD","1tOcTw3wNC7NrglW","H5Sc3OUYVruVA11R","k0tz1zO3741bUf4t","RMeZLKNUGmML9MMb","O4Mr0yKvMMqCmW8o","dVDPfUT8kiPIvoRR","KthzgQs9ltfFOXje","v18aXJpIKaCd5Fh4","Zuk6QTTjLxTqpsmn","b0l2Gm0R1DvcrgZ5","9eFYrddEvpqOrkV1","T8Ezcv87hdPtSDbb","rDSOwL68OFUeJvZ6","z7Nv1OqOVa9DbSZ6","pRTmfeSKQ4X7TjNd","86FYT85gjLly1PDK","c4l0gDl6BEK2CaVa","AwvX8r0Dpmhamr4F","OPfyi9ivt0InaEXb","66dtKIUqfelqC7kk","AlPbxguovoxPTMet","M7sVspfHZSCGkPB3","W6oYW5b8Ylon2YvG","oaQPnXy17nhfdQcU","tq4v9Tm2A5wAIhYF","6mMJCH3VP87wzthp","GCPgpwElCHLQVIOo","PNqYkMjgT8qLINIr"],"name":"Ioseff Xarwin","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":0},"dex":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":6},"str":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":3}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":29},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing, rejuvination","max":112,"temp":0,"value":112},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"precision"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":["non-magical"],"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch","vitality"],"type":"all-damage","value":10}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":25}],"value":0}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["aklo","common","diabolic"]},"level":{"value":9},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"","publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathf